It is six o'clock.
I am standing in the kitchen.
I am hungry.
I open the fridge.
It is completely empty.
I look in the cupboard.
There is no food in the cupboard.
I have no food.
I only have a little water.
I would like to have food now.
I like vegetables.
I also like bread.
But I have nothing here.
I find a bag.
The bag is red.
It is good for shopping.
I walk out of the flat.
I close the door.
I am ready.
Now I am walking to the supermarket.
